WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
What if the only thing between you and the

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.400
app in your head was a conversation?

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Welcome to Nabulines Academy.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Let's talk about what vibe coding is, and

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.800
why right now is the best time in history

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.000
to start building.

7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.600
Vibe coding is simple.

8
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.400
You describe what you want in plain

9
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.800
English, and AI writes the code.

10
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.000
You bring the taste, the idea, and the

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:26.400
