15
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.800
messages before you shipped anything real.

16
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.400
That wall is gone.

17
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.200
You're not learning to be a programmer.

18
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.000
You're learning to be a builder who

19
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:42.800
