20
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.400
Let me prove it.

21
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.200
Watch this.

22
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.400
I ask for a countdown timer, just those

23
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.000
words, and here it is, running live in the

24
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.400
browser.

25
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.800
I didn't write a single line.

26
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.400
No setup, no install.

27
00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.200
This is the real thing, actually working.

28
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.400
Every lesson in this academy is like this:

29
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.800
real prompts, real output, nothing faked.

30
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.000
So why now?

31
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.400
Three things lined up at once.

32
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.600
The models got good enough to write code

33
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.800
