41
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:32.800
That's you.

42
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.400
Here's your first move.

43
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.800
Before the next lesson, finish one

44
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.600
